      "source": "Spring Data supports Kotlin 1.9 and above and requires <code>kotlin-stdlib</code> and <code>kotlin-reflect</code> to be present on the classpath.\nThose are provided by default if you bootstrap a Kotlin project via <a href=\"https://start.spring.io/#!language=kotlin&amp;type=gradle-project\">start.spring.io</a>.",
      "translation": "Spring Data 支持 Kotlin 1.9 及以上版本，并需要在类路径中包含 `<code>kotlin-stdlib</code>` 和 `<code>kotlin-reflect`。如果您通过 <a href=\"https://start.spring.io/#!language=kotlin&amp;type=gradle-project\">start.spring.io</a> 启动 Kotlin 项目，这些依赖默认已提供。",
